{"id": "DeI8uRMhi3G", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "Ultralytics YOLO \u2014 5,040 guesses. 12 bird detections.\n\nUltralytics YOLO puts boxes, labels and scores on a frame. This example reports 5,040 prediction cells \u2192 92 boxes above 0.25 confidence \u2192 12 bird detections after NMS (IoU 0.7).\n\nWith Ultralytics 8.4.173 and yolo26l.pt, the default uses NMS. nms=False selects the NMS-free head; this frame returned 9 detections. These are one frame's results, not a benchmark or a guaranteed count.\n\n5,040\uac1c\uc758 \ucd94\uce21\uc5d0\uc11c \uc0c8 \uac80\ucd9c 12\uac1c\uae4c\uc9c0.\n\nUltralytics YOLO\ub294 \ud504\ub808\uc784\uc5d0 \uc0c1\uc790\uc640 \uc774\ub984, \uc810\uc218\ub97c \ubd99\uc5ec\uc694. \uc774\ubc88 \uc608\uc2dc\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 5,040\uce78 \uc911 \uc2e0\ub8b0\ub3c4 0.25\ub97c \ub118\uc740 \uc0c1\uc790 92\uac1c\ub97c NMS(IoU 0.7)\ub85c \uc815\ub9ac\ud574 \uc0c8 \uac80\ucd9c 12\uac1c\ub97c \ub0a8\uacbc\uc5b4\uc694.\n\n\uc0ac\uc6a9\ud55c 8.4.173\u00b7yolo26l.pt\uc758 \uae30\ubcf8 \uacbd\ub85c\ub294 NMS\ub97c \uc368\uc694. nms=False\ub85c \uace0\ub978 \ucd9c\ub825\ubd80\ub294 NMS \uc5c6\uc774 9\uac1c\ub97c \ub0c8\uc5b4\uc694. \ud55c \ud504\ub808\uc784\uc758 \uc81c\uc791 \uae30\ub85d\uc774\uba70, \uc131\ub2a5 \ud3c9\uac00\ub098 \uc2e4\uc81c \uac1c\uccb4 \uc218\ub97c \ubcf4\uc7a5\ud558\ub294 \uc218\uce58\uac00 \uc544\ub2d9\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ud654\uba74\uc758 \ud074\ub798\uc2a4\ub294 bird\u00b7zebra\uc608\uc694.\n\nCode/models: Ultralytics \u00b7 AGPL-3.0; Enterprise option. Check the terms for your use / \uc6a9\ub3c4\uc5d0 \ub9de\ub294 \uc870\uac74\uc744 \ud655\uc778\ud558\uc138\uc694.\nhttps://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics\nhttps://www.ultralytics.com/license\nYOLO paper: Redmon et al., 2015\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/1506.02640\nExplainer graphics: @hyun2xyz\n\nFootage / \uc6d0\ubcf8 \uc601\uc0c1: Wikimedia Commons\nJnpoJuwan \u00b7 CC0\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pigeon_feeding,_Jardim_da_Estrela,_2025_01.webm\nBamyers99 \u00b7 Public domain\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Equus_quagga_(zebra)_suckling_video.ogv\nUusijani \u00b7 CC0\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Giraffes_at_Artis.ogv\nRanch9613 \u00b7 CC0\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2026_A_Bus_Dart_at_Parker_Rd_Plano_TX.webm\nSeb35 \u00b7 CC0\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_grazing_horse_at_the_%C3%89comus%C3%A9e_de_la_Bintinais.webm\nDrummyfish \u00b7 CC0\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seagull_Feeding_Young_Croatia.webm\n\nCurated by @hyun2xyz", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1791261709, "like_count": 3186, "comment_count": 23, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2342711186543431a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 53.76, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNWV41oZYPX2aoa9exBotAlHUUKB-w3PSIXe8dpeqsJ8uYWZH4juby2TOq5xccaXNfkWoRl5KnE3DGzKSPHCPqXSxZ0jBTMTbSrBgg.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=-j7s59V6udkQ7kNvwFVrMpa&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=f0fVK8h38WdbWDibeGOG8A&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQMdjLTpvXfQnc2qavrvpXp6QPrze5fKa10nFEdnINFi9Q&oe=6AE2206A", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.76, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"Use